后，他的女儿吴小棠被拐卖。这一事件让吴吉重新燃起斗志，他踏上寻女之路，如猛龙过江般，凭借一己之力横扫以陈星、刘傲为代表的人犯组织。不仅如此，他还深入解决了南境四大家族的恩怨纠葛，最终成功救出女儿，揭露了背后的阴谋，回归了平静的生活。","series_id":"7454382613248101401","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233137785E0178D0B8948CA017\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7454382613248101401\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"collect\\\":0.03676946833729744,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7460454702377319,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.030416913330554962,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.05216646194458,\\\"like\\\":0.05184546485543251,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10215643793344498,\\\"finish\\\":0.002115704119205475}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7454382613248101401","play_cnt":116948,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"树下的椰子","sub_title":"都市·超凡逆袭","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":62,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5022,\"name\":\"都市\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5022&categoryName=都市&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5043,\"name\":\"超凡逆袭\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5043&categoryName=超凡逆袭&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5157,\"name\":\"天下无敌\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5157&categoryName=天下无敌&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5158,\"name\":\"强者回归\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5158&categoryName=强者回归&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5225,\"name\":\"男强\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5225&categoryName=男强&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch